# Rust build artifacts
target/
**/target/
# Per-worktree/per-agent Cargo target dirs. A shared target dir poisons builds
# across worktrees, so each gets its own — but `target/` above does not match
# `target-agent/` or `target-mine/`, and a stray one has already been committed
# once.
**/target-*/

# Node build artifacts
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
**/.pnpm-store/
dist/
**/dist/

# Coverage reports generated by explicit local checks and CI proofs.
**/coverage/

.omc/
.codex
